  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Was ist eine lineare Funktion?</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Eine <strong>lineare Funktion</strong> beschreibt eine gleichmäßige Veränderung – ihr Graph ist immer eine <strong>gerade Linie</strong>. Die allgemeine Form lautet:</p><div style='text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;letter-spacing:1px;margin:10px 0 4px;'>f(x) = m &middot; x + b</div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin:14px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;'><div style='flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;'><p style='font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;'>m – die Steigung</p><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;'><strong>m &gt; 0:</strong> Gerade steigt ↗<br><strong>m &lt; 0:</strong> Gerade fällt ↘<br><strong>m = 0:</strong> waagerechte Gerade<br><em>Je größer |m|, desto steiler.</em></p></div><div style='flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;'><p style='font-weight:700;color:#d97706;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;'>b – y-Achsenabschnitt</p><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;'>Wo schneidet die Gerade die y-Achse?<br><strong>f(0) = b</strong><br><br>b = 0 &rarr; Gerade durch den Ursprung<br>b &ne; 0 &rarr; Schnittpunkt verschoben</p></div></div><svg viewBox='0 0 200 165' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:260px;display:block;margin:10px auto 12px;'><defs><marker id='ax13' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='6' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,6 L7,3 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='26' y1='10' x2='26' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='44' y1='10' x2='44' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='62' y1='10' x2='62' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='98' y1='10' x2='98' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='116' y1='10' x2='116' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='134' y1='10' x2='134' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='152' y1='10' x2='152' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='170' y1='10' x2='170' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='147' x2='178' y2='147' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='134' x2='178' y2='134' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='121' x2='178' y2='121' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='95' x2='178' y2='95' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='82' x2='178' y2='82' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='69' x2='178' y2='69' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='56' x2='178' y2='56' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='43' x2='178' y2='43' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='18' y1='30' x2='178' y2='30' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='12' y1='108' x2='186' y2='108' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ax13)'/><line x1='80' y1='155' x2='80' y2='6' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ax13)'/><text x='190' y='112' font-size='10' fill='#555'>x</text><text x='84' y='4' font-size='10' fill='#555'>y</text><text x='44' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>-2</text><text x='116' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>2</text><text x='152' y='120' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>4</text><text x='74' y='137' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>-2</text><text x='74' y='85' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>2</text><text x='74' y='59' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>4</text><line x1='44' y1='147' x2='125' y2='30' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='127' y='25' font-size='10' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>f</text><line x1='62' y1='56' x2='152' y2='121' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='154' y='125' font-size='10' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>g</text><line x1='26' y1='128' x2='170' y2='76' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='172' y='72' font-size='10' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>h</text></svg><p style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:4px 0 8px;'>Drei Beispiele im Überblick:</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;'><strong style='color:#2563eb;'>f(x) = 2x + 1</strong><br>m = 2 (steil), b = 1</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;'><strong style='color:#16a34a;'>g(x) = &minus;x + 3</strong><br>m = &minus;1 (fällt), b = 3</div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;'><strong style='color:#d97706;'>h(x) = 0,5x</strong><br>m = 0,5 (flach), b = 0</div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;'><p style='font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;'>Warum heißt sie „linear"?</p><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Linear kommt von lateinisch <em>linea</em> = Linie. Die Variable x erscheint nur zur <strong>ersten Potenz</strong> (nie x², x³ …). Deshalb entsteht immer eine <strong>gerade Linie</strong> – keine Kurve.</p></div><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;'>🧠 <strong>Merke:</strong><br>&middot; <strong>m</strong> = Steigung – bestimmt Steilheit und Richtung<br>&middot; <strong>b</strong> = y-Achsenabschnitt – wo die Gerade die y-Achse schneidet<br>&middot; Der Graph ist immer eine <strong>gerade Linie</strong></div>",
